    "body": "I didn't find any breakage on [webcompat issues](https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/) related to `-webkit-mask-box` and `mask-border`.\r\n\r\nOn GitHub, CSS are usually already [associating the two propoerties](https://github.com/search?l=CSS&q=%22mask-border%22&type=Code) with the same value.\r\n\r\n* Usage of [-webkit-mask-box-image](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/css/timeline/popularity/281): around 0.8%\r\n* The rest is around 0.1% or less. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
